This patch set updates the lpfc driver to revision 8.3.24

The patches for 8.3.24. contain:

- Miscellaneous Fixes and Corrections
- Extended hardware support and support dump images
- Add SR-IOV control
- Add request-firmware support
- Add resource extent support
- Extend BSG infrastructure and add link diagnostics
- debugfs additions for SLI4
- Update driver version to 8.3.24

The patches were cut against scsi-misc-2.6. They need to be applied as a series

